---
description: Require rendered UI, 3D layout and narrative critique after each major website change
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the website quality standard in the repository-root `AGENTS.md`.
After each major implementation unit, inspect the actual desktop and phone experience, identify visual and physical-layout defects, fix them, and inspect again. A passing build is not visual acceptance.
Every element must earn its place through useful content, orientation, interaction or Sri's personal narrative. Check the full width of every local and connecting path, court boundaries, seat/screen orientation, ground contact, accessible controls and return navigation.
